                                    <td className="border border-default px-3 py-1.5">chains of arbitrary length, with the inclusive accumulator derived from the chain&rsquo;s payments rather than assumed &mdash; each position&rsquo;s comparison being the bilateral one on that position&rsquo;s own two figures</td>
